#### 3.11 Metrics Page

| Original CSS | Tailwind Replacement |
|---|---|
| `.metrics-page` | `<div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-4 content-start">` |
| `.metric-card` | `<div class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded p-4">` |
| `.metric-card h3` | `<h3 class="font-mono text-[0.8rem] text-accent mb-3 font-semibold">` |
